Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.5) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * New optional .vdi key display_name (shown to users on the Desktop card);
     falls back to the start.conf [OS] Name, then the group name.
     get_all_states() of masters and clones now carries name, display_name,
     ostype, os_family and activated per group, so edulution-ui can render one
     card per group instead of the fixed win11/ubuntu pair.
   * vdi-setup asks for the display name; templates carry one.
